WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.703
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
And this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.937
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:06.706
[ Cheers and applause ]
That's great to hear.

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:08.207
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:11.144
Former President Trump
spent last night at Trump Tower

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.145
after appearing
at his civil fraud trial.

00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:14.781
"It's good to be home,"
said Trump

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.616
as he walked into the courtroom.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:18.717
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:20.686
On the first day
of former President Trump's

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.789
civil fraud trial,
"The New York Post" reported

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.924
that a large takeout order
from McDonald's

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.393
was brought into the courthouse.

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:28.761
Wow.
I knew he was in trouble,

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:31.564
but I didn't know they were
seeking the death penalty.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:33.599
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:35.167
During the opening
of yesterday's trial,

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.102
former President Trump's lawyer
claimed that Trump's

00:00:37.102 --> 00:00:40.406
Mar-a-Lago club would sell
for at least $1 billion.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:43.710
Oh, I'm sure he could get that
just for what's in the shower.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.245
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.245 --> 00:00:48.147
After Florida Congressman
Matt Gaetz

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:49.816
filed a resolution
that would remove

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.584
Kevin McCarthy
from the speakership,

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.486
McCarthy tweeted, "Bring it on."

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:54.920
And Gaetz replied, "Just did."

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.456
You know, a lot of people think

00:00:57.456 --> 00:00:59.092
Joe Biden is too old
to govern,

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:02.095
but it sounds like
these guys aren't old enough.

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:03.730
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.365
After Matt Gaetz announced the
motion to remove Kevin McCarthy,

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:08.134
McCarthy said Gaetz has

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:11.137
"personal things in his life
that he has challenges with,"

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:14.474
like figuring out how
to set his Venmo to private.

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:18.177
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:21.114
Hunter Biden was arraigned
in Delaware today

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.448
on federal gun charges.

00:01:22.448 --> 00:01:25.552
We now go live
to the Fox News control room.

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:28.254
-[ Dramatic music plays ]
-[ All cheering ]

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.856 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:30.856 --> 00:01:33.626
You know, I'm happy for 'em.
They've had a --

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.327
They've had a rough time
recently.

00:01:35.327 --> 00:01:37.062
It's nice they get
a little light.

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:39.265
Justice Clarence Thomas
yesterday

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.167
recused himself from
a Supreme Court decision

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.468
for the first time,

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:43.970
not because he had
a conflict of interest --

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.272
just because he had
a fishing trip planned.

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:48.308
And it would have been rude
to cancel

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:50.209
'cause someone else paid for it.

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:52.812
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:56.281
Oh, you'd cancel
on a wealthy friend?!

00:01:56.281 --> 00:01:59.485
A wealthy friend would fly you
private to a fishing trip

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:01.020
and you would cancel?

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.622
I think not!

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:05.791
This poor ma--

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:08.794
You judge this poor man?

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:10.229
A pauper?!

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:12.132
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:19.906
A pauper who can only fish
if a wealthy patron fly --

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:22.675
And you judge him.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:23.977
Shame!

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.747
Jury selection began today
in the trial against

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:30.783
disgraced FTX CEO
Sam Bankman-Fried,

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:32.852
which is surprising
'cause by the looks of him,

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.787
he already got
the electric chair.

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:38.057
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:42.161
"No, he's still ali--
It didn't take."

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:44.363
The fast-food chain Taco Bell
announced today

00:02:44.363 --> 00:02:47.466
that it will add breakfast tacos
to its menu for the first time.

00:02:47.466 --> 00:02:51.004
Finally, some good news for
people who wake up still drunk.

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:52.772
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.174 --> 00:02:57.343
[Slurring]
"Yeah, I'll get a taco."

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.211
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.211 --> 00:03:00.813
Archaeologists in Spain believe

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:02.848
they have found
the oldest footwear

00:03:02.848 --> 00:03:04.183
ever discovered in Europe.

00:03:04.183 --> 00:03:07.553
So congratulations
to an American dad on vacation.

00:03:07.553 --> 00:03:09.589
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.391 --> 00:03:15.595
The first public beach
in Manhattan opened yesterday,

00:03:15.595 --> 00:03:18.264
and I feel like it's gonna
be hard to tell who's sunbathing

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:20.166
and who just washed up there.

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:23.169
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:26.839
"Hey, Johnny Three Fingers!
Enjoying the beach?

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:28.241
Johnny?"

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:30.009
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.313 --> 00:03:35.782
A woman in Chicago
recently went skydiving

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:38.017
at the age of 104.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.653
And if you're wondering
what was up with her parachute,

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:42.255
those were her breasts.

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:43.723
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:52.265
We have a writer
named Mike Scollins

00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:53.799
who wrote that joke, and --

00:03:53.799 --> 00:03:55.902
Yeah, you've heard of him.
You heard of him.

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:59.004
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:59.004 --> 00:04:02.008
Bad guy. Good writer.

00:04:02.008 --> 00:04:03.642
I always say,
"You're a good writer.

00:04:03.642 --> 00:04:07.280
Why don't you write for good?"

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.748
He's from Boston.
He's from Massachusetts and all.

00:04:09.748 --> 00:04:11.851
He gives you a hard time.

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:15.154
You tell him you don't
like his jokes, he's like...

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:17.890
It's just better to let it go.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:20.460
He goes, "Do you get it?"
I go, "I get it."

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.262
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.500
And, finally, last night's
Powerball jackpot --

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.069
I can't believe
Scollins got applause.

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:31.437
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:33.005
Nothing's worse --

00:04:33.005 --> 00:04:35.941
[ Applause ]

00:04:35.941 --> 00:04:38.143
Nothing worse
than trying to shame a guy

00:04:38.143 --> 00:04:41.180
and find out he has fans!

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:43.983
And, finally, last night's
Powerball jackpot

00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:47.153
reached
an estimated $1.2 billion...

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:50.790
or as Trump's accountant
calls it, $35 billion.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.925
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

